begin="00:21.083" end="00:21.675">stuck </span><span begin="00:21.675" end="00:22.187">by </span><span begin="00:22.187" end="00:22.955">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.443" end="00:24.747"><span begin="00:23.443" end="00:23.635">From </span><span begin="00:23.635" end="00:23.843">the </span><span begin="00:23.843" end="00:24.747">glue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.454" end="00:27.915"><span begin="00:25.454" end="00:25.891">Don't </span><span begin="00:25.891" end="00:26.587">forget </span><span begin="00:26.587" end="00:26.979">to </span><span begin="00:26.979" end="00:27.515">kiss </span><span begin="00:27.515" end="00:27.915">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.131" end="00:31.121"><span begin="00:28.131" end="00:28.560">Or </span><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:28.873">else </span><span begin="00:29.099" end="00:29.360">you'll </span><span begin="00:29.360" end="00:29.816">have </span><span begin="00:29.816" end="00:30.113">to </span><span begin="00:30.113" end="00:30.576">miss </span><span begin="00:30.576" end="00:31.121">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.320" end="00:35.552"><span begin="00:31.320" end="00:31.520">I </span><span begin="00:31.520" end="00:31.768">guess </span><span begin="00:31.768" end="00:32.056">I'm </span><span begin="00:32.432" end="00:33.113">stuck </span><span begin="00:33.113" end="00:34.401">forever </span><span begin="00:34.401" end="00:34.648">by </span><span begin="00:34.648" end="00:34.896">the </span><span begin="00:34.896" end="00:35.552">glue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.944" end="00:38.610"><span begin="00:35.944" end="00:36.200">Oh </span><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.528">and </span><span begin="00:36.528" end="00:38.610">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.667" end="00:53.464"><span begin="00:50.667" end="00:51.730">Finding </span><span begin="00:51.730" end="00:52.274">the </span><span begin="00:52.274" end="00:52.679">right </span><span begin="00:52.679"